# Certificate Generation Implementation Plan

We are implementing a professional certificate generation system. Students will be able to claim and download a high-quality PDF certificate upon successful completion of all course lessons and passing the final assessment.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Library Selection**: I am proposing `barryvdh/laravel-dompdf` for PDF generation. It allows us to use standard HTML/CSS for the certificate design.
> - **Issuance Criteria**: Certificates will only be issued if:
>   1. Course progress is 100%.
>   2. The final quiz (if exists) has a `passed` status.
> - **Design**: I will implement a premium "diploma-style" template with gold accents, secure verification numbers, and dynamic user/course data.

